- Study 7 used a point-of-care test to identify patients who might benefit from DDAVP

**CONSERVATIVE SCREENING APPROACH:**
- Following the conservative guideline, studies with any uncertainty about meeting criteria were INCLUDED rather than 
EXCLUDED
- Only studies that clearly violated the selection criteria (wrong study design, wrong population, wrong intervention) 
were excluded
- The 5 excluded studies clearly did not meet the RCT requirement or were not evaluating desmopressin efficacy

**NEXT STEPS RECOMMENDED:**
- Full-text review of all 20 included studies to verify eligibility criteria
- Data extraction for blood loss outcomes and transfusion requirements
- Assessment of risk of bias for each included RCT
- Consideration of heterogeneity in surgical procedures when synthesizing results

