aprotinin and DDAVP to reduce postoperative bleeding after cardiopulmonary bypass surgery", "abstract": "BACKGROUND     
Patients on cardiopulmonary bypass (CPB) have an increased susceptibility to postoperative bleeding. Previous reports   
