Intraoperative platelet counts and clot ratios were significantly higher in the untreated control group than in the     
study-drug groups. In intensive care, clot ratios in patients who received desmopressin were similar to those in the    
untreated control group, despite significantly lower platelet counts, but were lower in the placebo group than in the   
other two groups (p=0.0001). Compared with the placebo group, patients who received desmopressin had less blood loss in 
