  blood loss in uncomplicated coronary artery bypass patients."}, {"study_index": 32, "title": "Mortality and           
  morbidity in patients with very low postoperative Hb levels who decline blood transfusion", "abstract": "BACKGROUND   
  Guidelines for allogeneic transfusion emphasize minimizing use to avoid transmission of serious illness. However,     
  there is little information on the risks associated from withholding transfusion. STUDY DESIGN AND METHODS A          
