  percutaneous ultrasound‐guided kidney biopsy: a randomized controlled trial", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Bleeding        
  complications occur in one-third of percutaneous kidney biopsies and increase costs of the hospital stay. The aim of  
  the study was to evaluate the effect of prebiopsy administration of desmopressin acetate versus placebo in the        
  incidence of postbiopsy bleeding complications. STUDY DESIGN Double-blind randomized controlled clinical trial.       
